    "detailed_description": "Mythic Crusade is a roguelite turn based strategy RPG, made with passion by a one man dev team!  See if you have the galaxy brains to beat the single player mode or challenge your friends online or hotseat. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/d4bde68c131f7a09a5c51044b1a75865.poster.avif?t=1740684509\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/d4bde68c131f7a09a5c51044b1a75865.webm?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/d4bde68c131f7a09a5c51044b1a75865.mp4?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/8d17497a0047c45aef9e937884a86126.poster.avif?t=1740684509\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/8d17497a0047c45aef9e937884a86126.webm?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/8d17497a0047c45aef9e937884a86126.mp4?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/290251d458f6cb2660dd40ff0981ecd4.poster.avif?t=1740684509\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/290251d458f6cb2660dd40ff0981ecd4.webm?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/290251d458f6cb2660dd40ff0981ecd4.mp4?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synergies:</h2> Mix different hero skills, troops and spells to gain immense power and reach the holy land.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique unit abilities:</h2> Troops don't just deal damage in this game, each troop type has their own personalities and skills so you need master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crusade Mode:</h2> Whenever you start the Crusades, with <strong>Random Map Generator</strong>, the maps are a never the same. As you explore you'll find random events, unlock new skills, gain artifacts in a way no game is the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comes With:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online/Local Multiplayer<br></li><li>Hand drawn art<br></li><li>Level Editor<br></li><li>Random Map Generator<br></li><li>4 Factions... and more to come?</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Mythic Crusade is a roguelite turn based strategy RPG, made with passion by a one man dev team!  See if you have the galaxy brains to beat the single player mode or challenge your friends online or hotseat. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/d4bde68c131f7a09a5c51044b1a75865.poster.avif?t=1740684509\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/d4bde68c131f7a09a5c51044b1a75865.webm?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/d4bde68c131f7a09a5c51044b1a75865.mp4?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/8d17497a0047c45aef9e937884a86126.poster.avif?t=1740684509\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/8d17497a0047c45aef9e937884a86126.webm?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/8d17497a0047c45aef9e937884a86126.mp4?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/290251d458f6cb2660dd40ff0981ecd4.poster.avif?t=1740684509\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/290251d458f6cb2660dd40ff0981ecd4.webm?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872520/extras/290251d458f6cb2660dd40ff0981ecd4.mp4?t=1740684509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synergies:</h2> Mix different hero skills, troops and spells to gain immense power and reach the holy land.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique unit abilities:</h2> Troops don't just deal damage in this game, each troop type has their own personalities and skills so you need master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crusade Mode:</h2> Whenever you start the Crusades, with <strong>Random Map Generator</strong>, the maps are a never the same. As you explore you'll find random events, unlock new skills, gain artifacts in a way no game is the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comes With:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online/Local Multiplayer<br></li><li>Hand drawn art<br></li><li>Level Editor<br></li><li>Random Map Generator<br></li><li>4 Factions... and more to come?</li></ul>",
